From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew Branson <andrew.branson@jolla.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 18:30:56 +0200
Subject: [sailfishos][embedlite] Export embedding session APIs

ESR153 restricts libxul exports with an explicit symbol list. Export the
EmbedLite accessor, tokenized frame methods, and chrome, tab, input, and
content session entry points used by the external Qt embedder.
---
 toolkit/library/libxul.symbols | 13 +++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 13 insertions(+)

diff --git a/toolkit/library/libxul.symbols b/toolkit/library/libxul.symbols
index e63e3e74426b..4b7cd651d818 100644
--- a/toolkit/library/libxul.symbols
+++ b/toolkit/library/libxul.symbols
@@ -1,4 +1,17 @@
 XRE_GetBootstrap
+XRE_GetEmbedLite
+#if defined(MOZ_EMBEDLITE) && defined(XP_LINUX) && !defined(ANDROID)
+_ZN7mozilla9embedlite12EmbedLiteApp18CreateChromeWindow*
+_ZN7mozilla9embedlite12EmbedLiteApp21CreateChromeTabWindow*
+_ZN7mozilla9embedlite15EmbedLiteWindow16GetChromeSessionE*
+_ZN7mozilla9embedlite15EmbedLiteWindow23GetChromeContentSessionE*
+_ZN7mozilla9embedlite15EmbedLiteWindow21GetChromeInputSessionE*
+_ZN7mozilla9embedlite15EmbedLiteWindow19GetChromeTabSessionE*
+_ZN7mozilla9embedlite15EmbedLiteWindow20AcquirePlatformFrame*
+_ZN7mozilla9embedlite15EmbedLiteWindow20ReleasePlatformFrame*
+_ZN7mozilla9embedlite15EmbedLiteWindow24SetPlatformFrameListener*
+_ZN7mozilla9embedlite15EmbedLiteWindow31SetPlatformFrameDeliveryEnabled*
+#endif
 uprofiler_get
 #ifdef XP_IOS
 MainProcessInit
